*.MTS

# raw source photos dropped at the repo root for cropping — same reasoning
# as the AVCHD rule above; edited deliverables live in public/images/
# instead. Anchored to the root only (leading /) so it doesn't catch
# legitimate images already inside public/.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg

